# Local/runtime credentials and device identity
**/auth-store/
**/.env

# Extracted clients, caches, and generated bytecode
analyze/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/node_modules/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/

# Build and test output
*.test.exe
*.prof
coverage.out

# Comet runtime state is local, generated workflow data. Keep formal briefs,
# specs, and verification reports under docs/comet tracked.
docs/comet/runtime/
docs/comet/changes/*/runtime/
docs/comet/archive/*/runtime/
